{"4788840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Big Owl Night", "steam_appid": 4788840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4805920], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/24bb9f199b28531974428abd65a3dfef.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Big Owl Night is a fast-paced top-down roguelite where every night becomes a desperate fight against hordes of creatures, bizarre bosses and increasingly chaotic powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the post-apocalyptic downtown of São Paulo in the 2000s, collect coins, buy weapons, discover upgrades and survive for as long as you can while the night becomes more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you create different combinations of weapons, effects, relics and passive abilities. Some choices may look simple at first, but they can completely change the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/fc2e4e3d8b15dc37e91630035d43e4c7.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE AN EVER-CHANGING NIGHT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy waves grow more intense over time, bringing faster monsters, more aggressive bosses and situations that become harder to control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/f11944ff02ed27c100e53e205942ce69.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy weapons, upgrade your character and combine effects to create unique synergies. Every run can take a different path depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/7b246e0df6a19d7b0f95b465f6b39e74.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VISIT MERCHANTS AND SHOPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the night, you will find merchants offering items, weapons, relics and special upgrades that can change the course of your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/d8ad99182e2e5413dc3dcddde361f17a.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BIZARRE BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss has its own attacks, patterns and particle-based visual effects, keeping combat intense while preserving clear action readability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4788840/extras/03cd8ffcaaff0bcae0b6f72d9bc14849.avif?t=1781574089\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE AS LONG AS YOU CAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Big Owl Night is about resisting, improving, testing new combinations and trying to go further in a night that never seems to end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha